ay, just in the middle\r\n- Supports rebinding mouse buttons & keys like Right Shift\r\n## Changes\r\n- Increased the range for sensitivity sliders to 0.001 <-> 10.0\r\n- Made the \"Press Ctrl+i\" prompt in the top left fade out after 10 seconds\r\n- Increased default font size & measuring overlay width for EyeZoom\r\n- Added an FPS limit to the EyeZoom clone, defaulting to 60 fps\r\n- Disable \"Only on my screen\" for mirrors due to potential cheating issues\r\n- Added a hint about using Ctrl+Click in the GUI for slider input\r\n- Fixed various performance issues (more improvements yet to come)\r\n## Bug fixes\r\n- Fixed \"Reset to Defaults\" in modes tab setting width & height of thin & wide to 1 pixel\r\n- Fixed \"Reset to Defaults\" in mirrors tab not restoring mirror groups\r\n- Fixed key binding where it said a key was being held down when it wasn't\r\n- Fixed Window Overlays being missing from thin & wide modes\r\n- Fixed mirror output size/position not reloading properly when set to a relative percentage\r\n- Fixed custom theme colours not saving when restarting\r\n- Fixed mode width & height changes not saving when edited in the Basic tab\r\n- Fixed being able to drag window overlays after closing the config GUI\r\n- Potential fix for custom fonts causing rendering issues with the config GUI\r\n- Potential fix for a crash when editing config or using EyeZoom mode\r\n- Other fixes for performance & flicker issues\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/287653180/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/287637134","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/287637134/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/287637134/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/tag/v1.0.4"